:"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"4sTSg754V7-P-_Z97sT8Vw","review_id":"ocwV-D589OLexQwbDc-h3w","date":"2018-03-06T00:01:00","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9386130571365356,"text_excerpt":"This place is great. A little cheesy at times with all the people who frequent regularly, but they are tolerable. They have a great bar selection of beer and liquors and my favorite aspect is them being next to Lakeview Seafood. You can order from both spots and enjoy a nice night out under the stars. With an occasional drunk to entertain you."},{"business_id":"4sTSg754V7-P-_Z97sT8Vw","review_id":"duIfVNiV5VDe50Re5m16Yw","date":"2020-02-28T23:15:23","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9187085628509521,"text_excerpt":"This is a good spot in Lakeview. The bartenders are very friendly and professional. Afternoons tends to be a local crowd but later the young people show up and it has energy. Friday's are great because they have crawfish! Don't really have a complaint. Just a really good neighborhood spot."},{"business_id":"4sTSg754V7-P-_Z97sT8Vw","review_id":"mAQQzRVjF84rMkt3KcRO0g","date":"2011-03-30T17:57:03","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9092127084732056,"text_excerpt":"Small neighborhood bar with daily drink specials and ....CRAWFISH Fridays! For $6 you can enjoy a plate of crawfish, corn, and potatoes right out of the pot. (That is...if you can figure out the ticket system thing. I ended up having to wait over 2 hours for the crawfish b/c I \"apparently\" missed the first batch, but we had nothing better to do than enjoy some great cold beers while waiting!) *People do smoke here, but since they had the doors open it was well ventilated."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"4sTSg754V7-P-_Z97sT8Vw","photo_id":"ubd3FQPx79h4sjnmwe5z7g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ubd3FQPx79h4sjnmwe5z7g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9289078116416931},{"business_id":"4sTSg754V7-P-_Z97sT8Vw","photo_id":"-lcj9CN8stxRqk9zp5anHA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/-lcj9CN8stxRqk9zp5anHA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8989020586013794},{"business_id":"4sTSg754V7-P-_Z97sT8Vw","photo_id":"TlkzmH6wP2LGH4GBbItfpA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/TlkzmH6wP2LGH4GBbItfpA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8938063979148865},{"business_id":"4sTSg754V7-P-_Z97sT8Vw","photo_id":"YR9YGtX4VSWfiinJpZ2kEw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/YR9YGtX4VSWfiinJpZ2kEw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7565751075744629}]},"notebook_case":null}
